  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Which of the following represents the lattice structure of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>95</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> containing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mpadded lspace=\"-1px\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mpadded><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8211;</mo></mrow></msup></math> ions?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ca6c2cb7-289d-4766-bd6b-7808abaa641f-9896768.PNG\" style=\"width: 181px; height: 30px;\" /></p><p>A.<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fc7a20d3-d903-4158-b5b4-1d57fcf84518-9896768_1.PNG\" style=\"width: 374px; height: 230px;\" /></p><p>B.<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8c675a0a-ac21-4674-b331-1c12c6b4a6da-9896768_2.PNG\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\" /></p><p>C.<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/750dd03f-cbda-4759-a421-e6fb57784aa2-9896768_3.PNG\" style=\"width: 359px; height: 360px;\" />&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
